{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_227_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春，衞公叔戍來奔，晉趙陽出奔宋。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"二、二月，辛巳，楚公子結、陳公孫佗人帥師滅頓，以頓子牂歸。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"三、夏，衞北宮結來奔。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"四、五月，於越敗吳於檇李。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"五、吳子光卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"六、公會齊侯、衞侯於牽。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"七、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"八、秋，齊侯、宋公會於洮。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"九、天王使石尚來歸脤。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"脤者何也？俎實也，祭肉也。生曰脤，熟曰膰。其辭石尚，士也。何以知其士也？天子之大夫不名。石尚欲書春秋，諫曰：「久矣，周之不行禮於魯也，請行脤。」貴復正也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"十、衞世子蒯聵出奔宋。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"十一、衞公孟彄出奔鄭。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"十二、宋公之弟辰自蕭來奔。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"十三、大蒐於比蒲。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"十四、邾子來會公。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_227_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_227","textTraditional":"十五、城莒父及霄。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}